# ── Item descriptions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The .tres keeps ENGLISH and the English IS the msgid (src/meta/
# item_descriptions.gd). Resolution happens at render time, so a second language
# is a catalogue change and not a data-format change.
#
# SCOPE, and it is deliberately narrow: the items the meta loop surfaces. 122
# shipped resources declare a description and all 122 were untranslated at the
# time of writing, so an item outside this set renders WITHOUT the optional tail
# rather than with English in it. That is the honest-absence rule, and the
# translation sweep for the rest is content work, not a code change.
#
# M4_Carbine is absent on purpose: its .tres description is still the scaffold
# text "This Weapon is the default one." (card task_1790405682020_fa3fc5).
# Translating a placeholder would make it look handled.

msgid "5.56x45mm SS109 (VPAM PM7)"
msgstr "Munição 5,56x45mm SS109 (VPAM PM7)"

msgid "Compact 1x red-dot sight."
msgstr "Mira compacta 1x com ponto vermelho."

msgid "M16A2-style flash hider."
msgstr "Supressor de boca do tipo M16A2."

msgid "A sterile field bandage. Stops light bleeding."
msgstr "Bandagem de campanha esterilizada. Estanca hemorragias leves."

msgid "Combat application tourniquet. Stops heavy bleeding; leaves the limb unusable."
msgstr "Torniqueto de campo. Estanca hemorragias graves e inutiliza o membro."

msgid "Field medkit. Heals up to 85 HP and stops bleeding."
msgstr "Kit de primeiros socorros de campo. Recupera até 85 PV e estanca hemorragias."

msgid "A marked intel packet. Recover it and reach an extraction point."
msgstr "Um pacote de intel marcado. Recupere-o e chegue a um ponto de extração."
